 you like and work  together which is what kier tried to do  through most of uh co-vidic which what  we're trying to do in terms of the  ukraine situation and so on i think to  have seen such a remarkable turnaround  in our fortunes in such a small space of  time i think is to key as a great credit  good to talk to you as always thanks  very much indeed for joining us thank  you  thank you

